.doctype {slides}
.docname {FAU-LME Slides Example}
.docauthor {Sample Author}
.doclang {english}

<!-- 16:9. Quarkdown slides default to landscape; explicit px size keeps
     reveal.js scaling predictable (1280x720 = reveal's canonical 16:9). -->
.pageformat width:{1280px} height:{720px}

<!-- Fonts (Latin Modern Sans) come from the theme: slides.css sets
     font-family directly on the reveal content roots. No `.font` call here:
     it emits an exact-name local() lookup the print browser cannot resolve
     for this family. -->

.include {../slides.qd}

.slides transition:{none}

.lmetitlecard \
    title:{FAU-LME Slides Example} \
    author:{Sample Author} \
    event:{Master's Thesis Colloquium} \
    advisor:{Advisor Name} \
    chair:{Pattern Recognition Lab, Friedrich-Alexander-Universität Erlangen-Nürnberg} \
    date:{July 9, 2026}

# Agenda

<!-- Footer from this slide onward (margin content applies from its declaring
     slide); the title slide before this heading stays footer-free. -->
.lmeslidesfooter date:{July 9, 2026}

- Motivation
- **Approach** (bold renders in FAU blue)
- Results

# Fragments and math

Inline math with theme macros: $ \mat{A} \vec{x} = \vec{b} $

.fragment
    This line appears on the second interaction step.

.speakernote
    Speaker note: visible in speaker view (S), not on the slide.

# Closing slide

Final slide with a [link](https://www.fau.de) in FAU blue.
